{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30408","headline":"赠李从贵 · 赵嘏","name":"赠李从贵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马嘶风何处还，鞭梢拂地看南山。\n珠帘卷尽不回首，春色欲阑休闭关。\n花外鸟归残雨暮，竹边人语夕阳闲。\n知君旧隐嵩云下，岩桂从今几更攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}